# linear-issue/claude/body 160x45 @88,0 (72x41)
│                                                                     ✕
│  Linear draft
│
│  E  Honor Retry-After when the sync worker backs off after a 429
│
│───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
│X: The sync worker doubles its delay after every `429` and never reads
│   `Retry-After`, so it retries sooner than the shop API allows and
│   gets limited again.
│
│   - Read `Retry-After` (seconds or an HTTP date) from the `429`
│   response
│   - Wait at least that long, then go back to the doubling delay
│   - Cap the wait at `MAX_DELAY`
│
│   **Where:** `src/sync.sh`, `src/config.sh`
│
│   **Done when:** a `429` with `Retry-After: 30` makes the worker wait
│   30 seconds before its next try.
│
│
│
